    "description": "Gartic.io welcomes you with the fun of guessing and drawing! In each round, a player draws something for the others to guess what it is.\r\n\r\nChoose one of the words to draw, and let the game begin! The player who achieves the points goal first gets the top place.\r\n\r\nYou can also choose from the available themes or even create your own room, inviting up to 50 friends by sharing the link.",
